    "https://jobs.wrexham.ac.uk/display.aspx?id=1929&pid=0&tabId=230": {
      "title": "Staff Benefits",
      "description": "Staff Benefits - Jobs at Wrexham Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies Guidance for Job Applicants About the University Campuses and Facilities Campus 2025 Equality, Diversity and Inclusion Staff Benefits Contact Us Accessibility Cookies Contact Us Terms of Use Study Student life International Business Connect Research About Home Login Register Cymraeg Toggle Menu Home Login Register Cymraeg Study Student life International Business Connect Research About This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Job Vacancies Staff Benefits Staff Benefits Our goal is to make Wrexham University feel like a community and our employees are the foundation for the University's success. Along with our commitment to attracting, recruiting and retaining the highest calibre of staff, we offer an attractive range of competitive benefits to all staff. Please click on the images below for a full list of related benefits that we believe will be important to you. Onsite Facilities Family Friendly Policies Health and Well-being Financial Rewards, Benefits & Well-being Personal and Professional Development Jobs at Wrexham Jobs Home Current Vacancies Guidance for Job Applicants About the University Campuses and Facilities Campus 2025 Equality, Diversity and Inclusion Staff Benefits Contact Us Job Notifications Jobs by Email Latest Vacancies Senior Lecturer in Nutrition and Dietetics Sports Partnership Impact Manager Specialist Study Skills Tutor View All Vacancies Study with us Undergraduate courses Postgraduate courses Short courses Online Courses Apply Quick Links Contact Us Open days Virtual tours Online Shop Welcome Week Academic Timetable Staff & Students Student Portal Staff Portal Job Vacancies Contact Wrexham University, Mold Road, Wrexham, LL11 2AW 01978 290666 We welcome calls in Welsh or English. Rydym yn croesawu galwadau yn Gymraeg neu Saesneg. Facebook Instagram X YouTube TikTok © Wrexham University Accessibility Cookies Contact Us Terms of Use"
