    "https://jobs.wrexham.ac.uk/Vacancy.aspx?ref=2627062": {
      "title": "Quality and Regulations Manager",
      "description": "2627062 Quality and Regulations Manager - Jobs at Wrexham Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies Guidance for Job Applicants About the University Campuses and Facilities Campus 2025 Equality, Diversity and Inclusion Staff Benefits Contact Us Accessibility Cookies Contact Us Terms of Use Study Student life International Business Connect Research About Home Login Register Cymraeg Toggle Menu Home Login Register Cymraeg Study Student life International Business Connect Research About This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Job Vacancies 2627062 Quality and Regulations Manager Quality and Regulations Manager Fixed term up to 21.09.2027 Reporting to the Head of Quality, the Quality and Regulations Manager will manage the Quality and Regulations Team and provide operational oversight of the University's academic quality assurance processes, academic governance arrangements and regulatory compliance framework. The post holder will be responsible for ensuring the effective delivery of key institutional quality assurance activities, including the review and enhancement of academic regulations, policies and procedures, annual monitoring, external examining, professional accreditation oversight and committee governance. The role also provides leadership for complex student casework, ensuring the consistent application of University regulations and procedures, while providing expert advice and guidance to colleagues across the institution. Through effective line management, stakeholder engagement and service improvement, the post holder will support the maintenance of academic standards, regulatory compliance and continuous enhancement across the University. For further information please email Helen Weller on helen.weller@wrexham.ac.uk Further details Job Description - Welsh Job Description - English Email details to a friend Apply Online Wrexham University is an equal opportunities employer and positively encourages applications from suitably qualified and eligible candidates and will ensure applicants will not be discriminated against due to their protected characteristics under the Equality Act 2010. The University will make all efforts to meet your access requirements. Please contact our People Team as soon as possible to discuss any adjustments or assistance you may need to complete your application form, or to answer any queries you may have. We welcome applications in Welsh and English. Any applications submitted in Welsh will not be treated less favourably than applications submitted in English. Excellence, Inclusion, Collaboration, Transformation & Sustainability Share: View All Vacancies Job Details Programme/Department Quality and Regulation Location Wrexham Salary £46,048 to £50,252\n              per annum Post Type Full Time Fixed Term Until Tuesday 21 September 2027 Closing Date Sunday 13 September 2026 Reference 2627062 Welsh Language Skills Welsh language skills are desirable Apply Online Jobs at Wrexham Jobs Home Current Vacancies Guidance for Job Applicants About the University Campuses and Facilities Campus 2025 Equality, Diversity and Inclusion Staff Benefits Contact Us Job Notifications Jobs by Email Study with us Undergraduate courses Postgraduate courses Short courses Online Courses Apply Quick Links Contact Us Open days Virtual tours Online Shop Welcome Week Academic Timetable Staff & Students Student Portal Staff Portal Job Vacancies Contact Wrexham University, Mold Road, Wrexham, LL11 2AW 01978 290666 We welcome calls in Welsh or English. Rydym yn croesawu galwadau yn Gymraeg neu Saesneg. Facebook Instagram X YouTube TikTok © Wrexham University Accessibility Cookies Contact Us Terms of Use"
