    "https://jobs.wrexham.ac.uk/Subs/": {
      "title": "Jobs by Email",
      "description": "Jobs by Email - Jobs at Wrexham Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies Guidance for Job Applicants About the University Campuses and Facilities Campus 2025 Equality, Diversity and Inclusion Staff Benefits Contact Us Accessibility Cookies Contact Us Terms of Use Study Student life International Business Connect Research About Home Login Register Cymraeg Toggle Menu Home Login Register Cymraeg Study Student life International Business Connect Research About This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Job Vacancies Jobs by Email Jobs by Email We  offer a free email service to alert you to jobs you may be interested in. This service will send you all the new vacancies in categories you may be interested in. You can refine your requirements with keywords and a desired salary range. You must Register or Login to use Jobs by Email. Jobs at Wrexham Jobs Home Current Vacancies Guidance for Job Applicants About the University Campuses and Facilities Campus 2025 Equality, Diversity and Inclusion Staff Benefits Contact Us Job Notifications Jobs by Email Latest Vacancies Senior Lecturer in Nutrition and Dietetics Sports Partnership Impact Manager Specialist Study Skills Tutor View All Vacancies Study with us Undergraduate courses Postgraduate courses Short courses Online Courses Apply Quick Links Contact Us Open days Virtual tours Online Shop Welcome Week Academic Timetable Staff & Students Student Portal Staff Portal Job Vacancies Contact Wrexham University, Mold Road, Wrexham, LL11 2AW 01978 290666 We welcome calls in Welsh or English. Rydym yn croesawu galwadau yn Gymraeg neu Saesneg. Facebook Instagram X YouTube TikTok © Wrexham University Accessibility Cookies Contact Us Terms of Use"
